    <string name="privacy_body">Silamɛ bɛ i ka danbe bonya ani a tɛ i ka kunnafoniw lajɛ.\n\n• Tracking tɛ: ad SDKs, analytics walima marketing trackers tɛ.\n• Donanw bɛ to i ka minɛn kan: i ka kunnafoniw bɛɛ (yɔrɔ, sigida, taamasiyɛnw) bɛ mara sigida la i ka minɛn dɔrɔn kan.\n• Yɔrɔ bɛ kɛ sigida la: i ka coordinates bɛ kɛ ka delili jate waatiw ni qibla minnu bɛ i ka minɛn kan, wa u tɛ ci abada kɛnɛma baarakɛla si ma.\n• Iziniw dɔrɔn ni mago bɛ u la: an bɛ yamaruyaw ɲini (yɔrɔ, kunnafoniw) dɔrɔn ni fɛn dɔ mago bɛ u la tiɲɛ na, ni ɲɛfɔli jɛlen ye.\n• Jɛɲɔgɔnya jagoyalen tɛ : appli bɛ baara kɛ ɛntɛrinɛti kɔkan ɛntɛrinɛti baara ye ŋaniyata ye pewu fɛn wɛrɛw kama i n’a fɔ kalansenw telesarseli.\n\nNin sariya in ye da wulilen marayɔrɔ dɔ ye, wa a dabɔra sigidamɔgɔw ka seginnkanni kama.</string>
